KONOHAGAKURE BINGO BOOK — S-RANK THREAT PROFILE

Name: Kisame Hoshigaki
Alias: "Monster of the Hidden Mist," "Tailless Tailed Beast"
Village of Origin: Kirigakure (defected)
Status: Missing-nin / Akatsuki member
Threat Level: S-Rank
Bounty: 35,000,000 ryo

Background: Former member of the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist. Wields the sentient sword Samehada, which shaves and absorbs an opponent's chakra. Possesses colossal chakra reserves.

Known Abilities:
- Water Release: Water Shark Bomb, Great Waterfall Technique, Water Prison.
- Samehada: chakra absorption, fuses with wielder to grant shark-like traits.
- Can create large-scale water terrain even in dry environments.

Engagement Notes: Partnered with Itachi Uchiha. Avoid drawn-out chakra battles — Samehada replenishes his reserves at the enemy's expense. Sensor support advised. Extreme caution near any water source.
